Replaces the single-player [b]Dart Rifle[/b] with a VSS Vintorez. Same slot, same place in the bazaar, different gun.

[list]
[*][b]The VSS mesh[/b] on the Dragunov's skeleton and animation set, in all five LOD tiers, with its own collision shape and muzzle socket.[/*]
[*][b]Textures[/b], including a worn control map that grimes the weapon as its condition drops, plus the HUD, bazaar and weapon-select icons.[/*]
[*][b]Semi-automatic, ten rounds[/b], off the sniper rifle ammo pool instead of darts.[/*]
[*][b]The Dragunov's jam and break behaviour[/b], in place of a weapon that never failed at all.[/*]
[*][b]Its own shot sound[/b], and a [b]reload animation[/b] rebuilt for the VSS.[/*]
[/list]
Damage stays the Dart Rifle's, which is what keeps it a stealth weapon rather than a battle rifle. It is silent, and it does not tranquilize.
[b]The animations are the Dragunov's, and they do not fit the VSS perfectly.[/b] The weapon rides the Dragunov's skeleton and plays its animation set, so the hands do not sit quite right on this gun. The reload is the one clip rebuilt for the VSS, and it is there to prove a replacement weapon can carry its own animation - not because the rest are finished.

[size=4][b]Installing[/b][/size]

The download is a JackAll layer, which both installers read as-is:
[list]
[*][b]Vortex[/b] - with the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/site/mods/2143]Far Cry 2 extension[/url] installed, drop the zip in and enable it.[/*]
[*][b]JackAll[/b] - add the zip in [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/farcry2/mods/370]JackAll[/url][/*]
[/list]

[b]Buy the weapon again after installing.[/b] A weapon already in your inventory keeps the archetype it was acquired with, so a save that already holds a Dart Rifle shows the new model on the old behaviour.
Only English is renamed - the other ten languages still say "Dart Rifle" in the bazaar, the challenge list and the statistics.

[size=4][b]Replacing a weapon yourself[/b][/size]
The whole procedure this was built by is written up, step by step, so you can do it to any other weapon in the game: [url=https://jbebe.github.io/farcry-sdk/docs/modding/replacing-a-weapon]Replacing an existing weapon[/url].

